<p>Create a command to use an object.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Command%20keyword" title="Command keyword">command</a> CommandUseObject(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oTarget,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nAction<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oTarget<dd>the object to use<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nAction<dd>the action to use on the object
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>a valid command
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
